00:26:20.559 --> 00:26:21.759
I ran him over. He died.

00:27:07.759 --> 00:27:09.559
You liked what you saw today too,
didn't you?

00:27:31.200 --> 00:27:31.839
It's for you.

00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:39.640
Go buy something to eat.

00:27:41.720 --> 00:27:42.960
Get whatever you want.

00:27:43.599 --> 00:27:45.000
You'll never go hungry again.

00:28:10.839 --> 00:28:11.880
Where are you going?

00:28:12.559 --> 00:28:13.440
I can give you a ride.

00:28:13.799 --> 00:28:14.960
That wouldn't be appropriate.

00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:17.800
I work at the Cultural Center.

00:28:18.279 --> 00:28:19.199
Here's my card.

00:28:19.200 --> 00:28:20.640
(Chaobei Cultural Center
Zhou Xijie)

00:29:22.000 --> 00:29:22.759
(Okay.)

00:29:23.079 --> 00:29:24.759
(Yes, yes. Good. Very good.)

00:29:34.240 --> 00:29:34.920
(Get out.)

00:29:36.960 --> 00:29:38.400
(Save the best for me.)

00:29:44.759 --> 00:29:46.640
(I'll take you to the happiest place.)

00:30:27.720 --> 00:30:28.719
(Lanyun Refreshment Shop)

00:30:28.720 --> 00:30:29.599
We're closed.

00:30:32.559 --> 00:30:33.119
Ma'am.

00:30:33.640 --> 00:30:34.199
Take a look.

00:30:34.200 --> 00:30:35.839
Have you seen this girl?

00:30:36.759 --> 00:30:37.480
No.

00:30:42.839 --> 00:30:43.200
Hello?

00:30:43.559 --> 00:30:44.119
(Dongchen.)

00:30:44.480 --> 00:30:45.480
Any word on Na?

00:30:45.799 --> 00:30:46.319
(No.)

00:30:46.640 --> 00:30:47.960
(Police came looking for you.)

00:30:53.160 --> 00:30:53.880
Got it.

00:30:54.200 --> 00:30:55.240
From now on,

00:30:55.400 --> 00:30:56.440
if anyone asks about me,

00:30:56.920 --> 00:30:57.920
say you know nothing.

00:30:58.480 --> 00:31:00.119
Just focus on finding Na.

00:31:00.480 --> 00:31:01.598
Karaoke bars,

00:31:01.599 --> 00:31:02.359
barbecue places,

00:31:02.519 --> 00:31:03.278
anywhere you think

00:31:03.279 --> 00:31:04.799
Na might've gone,

00:31:05.119 --> 00:31:06.359
check all of them.

00:31:06.759 --> 00:31:07.720
Got it?

00:31:09.839 --> 00:31:11.160
Where are you taking me?

00:31:13.680 --> 00:31:15.160
Where are you taking me?

00:31:23.279 --> 00:31:24.598
I can't walk anymore.

00:31:24.599 --> 00:31:25.639
I'm exhausted.

00:31:25.640 --> 00:31:26.640
I can't walk anymore.

00:31:38.799 --> 00:31:39.798
Please stop tying me up.

00:31:39.799 --> 00:31:40.358
Please.

00:31:40.359 --> 00:31:41.279
Let me go.

00:31:41.759 --> 00:31:42.919
Please, don't tie me up.

00:31:42.920 --> 00:31:43.999
I'll pay you a lot.

00:31:44.000 --> 00:31:45.200
Just let me go, okay?

00:31:48.720 --> 00:31:49.920
Let me go.

00:31:50.039 --> 00:31:51.279
Please.

00:32:01.880 --> 00:32:02.598
Do you remember

00:32:02.599 --> 00:32:03.680
how you got here?

00:32:04.880 --> 00:32:06.400
Who was the last person you saw?

00:32:07.119 --> 00:32:08.160
Are you Su Lin?

00:32:09.039 --> 00:32:09.880
Is that you?

00:32:10.759 --> 00:32:12.038
Can you let me out?

00:32:12.039 --> 00:32:12.960
Please.

00:32:13.079 --> 00:32:14.079
Answer my question.

00:32:14.359 --> 00:32:15.799
How did you get here?

00:32:18.200 --> 00:32:19.000
All I remember is

00:32:19.839 --> 00:32:21.720
someone gave me a note.

00:32:22.440 --> 00:32:24.000
The note said

00:32:25.039 --> 00:32:27.240
to wait at that school's back gate.

00:32:37.960 --> 00:32:38.599
Then...

00:32:39.759 --> 00:32:40.240
Then

00:32:40.440 --> 00:32:42.240
after that, I don't remember anything.

00:32:44.599 --> 00:32:45.999
I really can't remember.

00:32:46.000 --> 00:32:47.679
I can't remember anything.

00:32:47.680 --> 00:32:48.278
Please.

00:32:48.279 --> 00:32:49.318
Let me out.

00:32:49.319 --> 00:32:50.240
Please.

00:33:02.960 --> 00:33:03.599
Coming!

00:33:13.559 --> 00:33:14.519
You scared me.

00:33:15.519 --> 00:33:16.480
What are you doing here?

00:33:17.319 --> 00:33:18.319
Didn't you move?

00:33:19.200 --> 00:33:20.359
Mr. Gu.

00:33:21.039 --> 00:33:21.559
You...

00:33:22.839 --> 00:33:24.000
What happened to your face?

00:33:24.640 --> 00:33:25.440
I was going downhill.

00:33:26.960 --> 00:33:28.759
I was riding too fast.

00:33:29.160 --> 00:33:30.440
I braked with my face.

00:33:30.720 --> 00:33:31.839
Your face?

00:33:33.119 --> 00:33:34.759
Aren't you supposed to use the brakes?

00:33:37.079 --> 00:33:38.200
Kidding.

00:33:40.359 --> 00:33:42.759
They're battle scars
from fighting bad guys.

00:33:44.319 --> 00:33:45.319
Let me blow on it.

00:33:45.440 --> 00:33:46.279
It'll feel better.

00:33:49.160 --> 00:33:49.919
Good kid.

00:33:49.920 --> 00:33:50.559
Much better.

00:33:52.839 --> 00:33:54.400
You still haven't said why you're here.

00:33:54.559 --> 00:33:56.720
Didn't you say I could use your phone?

00:33:57.240 --> 00:33:58.599
I want to call my sister.

00:33:58.799 --> 00:34:00.119
You have her number?

00:34:04.079 --> 00:34:04.559
Right here.

00:34:04.799 --> 00:34:05.519
Dad gave it to me.

00:34:10.559 --> 00:34:11.199
(Hello.)

00:34:11.480 --> 00:34:13.599
(The number you dialed
is not in service.)

00:34:13.760 --> 00:34:15.239
(Please check and try again.)

00:34:15.920 --> 00:34:17.920
(The number you dialed
is not in service.)

00:34:18.159 --> 00:34:19.639
(Please check and try again.)

00:34:21.199 --> 00:34:21.880
Mr. Gu.

00:34:22.800 --> 00:34:24.239
What does "not in service" mean?

00:34:24.480 --> 00:34:25.480
You dialed it right?

00:34:32.960 --> 00:34:33.480
(Hello.)

00:34:33.719 --> 00:34:35.880
(The number you dialed
is not in service.)

00:34:36.039 --> 00:34:37.440
(Please check and try again.)

00:34:40.280 --> 00:34:41.199
0825-

00:34:42.400 --> 00:34:43.400
687-

00:34:44.760 --> 00:34:45.840
3352.

00:34:48.360 --> 00:34:48.880
(Hello.)

00:34:49.280 --> 00:34:51.320
(The number you dialed
is not in service.)

00:34:51.599 --> 00:34:53.079
(Please check and try again.)

00:34:56.800 --> 00:34:58.400
Could you have remembered it wrong?

00:34:59.039 --> 00:35:00.039
No way.

00:35:00.440 --> 00:35:02.559
I memorized it really carefully.

00:35:04.920 --> 00:35:05.719
Not in service

00:35:06.159 --> 00:35:08.079
means that number doesn't exist.

00:35:10.880 --> 00:35:12.559
Then Dad wrote it down wrong?

00:35:19.760 --> 00:35:21.199
I'll go home and ask him.

00:35:21.880 --> 00:35:22.239
I...

00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:23.920
Can I come back and call after?

00:35:24.320 --> 00:35:24.800
Sure.

00:35:26.119 --> 00:35:27.079
Su Zhe.

00:35:28.840 --> 00:35:29.639
Your mom.

00:35:33.800 --> 00:35:34.559
Mom.

00:35:35.239 --> 00:35:35.880
Mom.

00:35:36.199 --> 00:35:37.840
Where did you go?

00:35:38.199 --> 00:35:40.440
Why didn't you come straight home?

00:35:40.599 --> 00:35:42.199
You scared me to death.

00:35:43.159 --> 00:35:44.480
Why are you running around?

00:35:45.039 --> 00:35:45.599
I...

00:35:45.840 --> 00:35:47.039
I was making a call.

00:35:50.320 --> 00:35:51.359
Sorry, Mr. Gu.

00:35:51.360 --> 00:35:52.639
Sorry for the trouble.

00:35:54.360 --> 00:35:55.760
What happened to your head?

00:36:01.760 --> 00:36:03.239
Police came to see us.

00:36:14.000 --> 00:36:15.400
Lin is still alive.

00:36:21.679 --> 00:36:22.440
Mom.

00:36:24.119 --> 00:36:25.000
Where's my sister?

00:36:26.639 --> 00:36:27.440
Go home.

00:36:29.239 --> 00:36:30.079
Mom.

00:36:33.199 --> 00:36:33.880
Mom.

00:36:45.000 --> 00:36:45.800
Another one.

00:36:46.360 --> 00:36:47.440
You and your apprentice,

00:36:47.599 --> 00:36:48.920
stop wrecking my files.

00:36:49.360 --> 00:36:50.480
If you're upset,

00:36:50.719 --> 00:36:51.679
sweep the floor for me.

00:36:53.880 --> 00:36:54.519
What?

00:36:55.119 --> 00:36:55.960
Tai Wei was here?

00:36:56.199 --> 00:36:56.999
Tai Wei

00:36:57.000 --> 00:36:58.319
came and checked every file

00:36:58.320 --> 00:36:59.119
this morning.

00:36:59.559 --> 00:37:00.479
You are both

00:37:00.480 --> 00:37:01.639
all over the place.

00:37:01.760 --> 00:37:02.480
What is it?

00:37:02.880 --> 00:37:04.199
Can't bear to leave me?

00:37:07.880 --> 00:37:09.480
I know when this case is over,

00:37:09.800 --> 00:37:11.000
you're moving to desk duty.

00:37:11.639 --> 00:37:13.039
Finally some time to heal.

00:37:13.440 --> 00:37:14.280
Congrats.

00:37:15.039 --> 00:37:15.719
Du.

00:37:16.039 --> 00:37:17.400
This case isn't over.

00:37:25.920 --> 00:37:27.360
Acting all mysterious.

00:37:29.440 --> 00:37:30.400
Are you done?

00:37:30.840 --> 00:37:32.360
I don't think we can close it yet.

00:37:32.719 --> 00:37:33.558
That drifter

00:37:33.559 --> 00:37:35.118
doesn't really match the profile

00:37:35.119 --> 00:37:36.519
we built for the suspect.

00:37:36.840 --> 00:37:37.678
Something's off.

00:37:37.679 --> 00:37:38.679
I know something's wrong.

00:37:39.239 --> 00:37:40.159
Police work

00:37:40.599 --> 00:37:41.719
is about evidence,

00:37:42.159 --> 00:37:43.159
not feelings.

00:37:44.800 --> 00:37:46.119
You think something's wrong.

00:37:46.760 --> 00:37:47.519
Evidence?

00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:50.039
The evidence is,

00:37:50.519 --> 00:37:51.638
where he lived

00:37:51.639 --> 00:37:53.599
connects to the storm drain network,

00:37:53.880 --> 00:37:55.679
which is where the body was found.

00:37:56.400 --> 00:37:57.559
In the stormwater reservoir,

00:37:57.880 --> 00:37:59.159
they found the victim's wallet.

00:37:59.360 --> 00:38:00.880
Tech finally managed

00:38:01.000 --> 00:38:02.679
to lift a print from it.

00:38:03.800 --> 00:38:04.320
And

00:38:05.039 --> 00:38:06.159
Sun Hui's bike.

00:38:06.360 --> 00:38:07.320
He sold it, right?

00:38:08.119 --> 00:38:09.000
Most importantly,

00:38:09.239 --> 00:38:11.038
DNA recovered from the scene

00:38:11.039 --> 00:38:12.360
belonged to the drifter.

00:38:12.480 --> 00:38:14.599
It exactly matched the DNA

00:38:14.880 --> 00:38:17.719
from semen found in the victim.

00:38:18.480 --> 00:38:19.679
The evidence is conclusive.

00:38:20.199 --> 00:38:21.239
I have to close the case.

00:38:22.119 --> 00:38:22.880
Alright.

00:38:23.599 --> 00:38:24.840
Stop wasting time here.

00:38:26.360 --> 00:38:27.400
Is your report done?

00:38:27.880 --> 00:38:29.760
The case isn't closed. How can I?

00:38:31.320 --> 00:38:32.119
Wang Xianjiang.

00:38:33.360 --> 00:38:34.320
Keep him in line.

00:38:44.519 --> 00:38:45.119
Tai Wei.

00:39:09.559 --> 00:39:10.559
Wang Xianjiang.

00:39:10.880 --> 00:39:12.400
So this is your good student?

00:39:14.440 --> 00:39:15.840
You mad about it too?

00:39:16.519 --> 00:39:17.480
I'm not.

00:39:17.840 --> 00:39:19.079
If you weren't,

00:39:19.480 --> 00:39:20.799
what I just said

00:39:20.800 --> 00:39:22.599
should've come from you, not me.

00:39:23.920 --> 00:39:24.679
Director Hu.

00:39:25.960 --> 00:39:28.000
If you were me, wouldn't you be mad?

00:39:28.920 --> 00:39:30.880
Two years. Old case, new case.

00:39:31.239 --> 00:39:32.360
Several lives lost.

00:39:34.119 --> 00:39:35.360
We finally got a lead on the suspect,

00:39:35.719 --> 00:39:36.880
then he got run over.

00:39:38.119 --> 00:39:39.119
Why did he kill?

00:39:39.400 --> 00:39:40.440
How did he do it?

00:39:40.599 --> 00:39:42.238
Don't we owe the victims' families

00:39:42.239 --> 00:39:43.159
an explanation?

00:39:50.800 --> 00:39:51.440
We

00:39:52.360 --> 00:39:53.480
need to cool off.

00:39:54.920 --> 00:39:56.239
We're both old hands.

00:39:57.079 --> 00:39:58.079
I understand you.

00:39:58.599 --> 00:40:00.239
Try to understand me too.

00:40:00.800 --> 00:40:02.119
I can't.

00:40:03.320 --> 00:40:04.719
This case still has loose ends.

00:40:05.440 --> 00:40:06.760
If we close it this hastily,

00:40:07.519 --> 00:40:09.519
will the victims' families forgive us?

00:40:18.639 --> 00:40:20.079
Director Hu, I know you mean well.

00:40:20.639 --> 00:40:21.719
You want me on desk duty.

00:40:22.519 --> 00:40:23.759
But because of this case,

00:40:23.760 --> 00:40:25.119
I can't eat or sleep.

00:40:26.599 --> 00:40:27.800
I'm begging you.

00:40:29.920 --> 00:40:30.960
Give me more time.

00:40:34.360 --> 00:40:35.279
(Today's News.)

00:40:35.280 --> 00:40:37.279
(Police identified a suspect)

00:40:37.280 --> 00:40:39.280
(in the Weihong Canal case.)

00:40:39.639 --> 00:40:40.800
(However, the suspect)

00:40:40.960 --> 00:40:43.800
(died in a traffic accident last night.)

00:40:44.000 --> 00:40:45.159
(DNA testing confirmed)

00:40:45.280 --> 00:40:46.158
(the suspect's)

00:40:46.159 --> 00:40:46.839
(DNA)

00:40:46.840 --> 00:40:47.399
(matched)

00:40:47.400 --> 00:40:48.440
(the killer's DNA.)

00:40:51.560 --> 00:40:52.456
(End of Evil?)

00:40:52.457 --> 00:40:53.238
(Killer ID'd by DNA.)

00:40:53.239 --> 00:40:54.238
(Killer Dies. Justice or More?)

00:40:54.239 --> 00:40:55.039
A newspaper, please.

00:41:04.280 --> 00:41:04.719
(End of Evil.)

00:41:04.720 --> 00:41:07.599
(Killer ID'd by DNA.)

00:41:07.600 --> 00:41:10.000
(Killer Dies. Justice or More?)

00:41:13.160 --> 00:41:13.959
(DNA Match)

00:41:13.960 --> 00:41:15.159
(Serial Killer)

00:41:15.160 --> 00:41:16.279
(Caused Death)

00:41:16.280 --> 00:41:18.198
I told you to mess with her.
And now you won't?

00:41:18.199 --> 00:41:19.440
No good.

00:41:19.840 --> 00:41:20.920
Wrong.

00:41:39.080 --> 00:41:42.440
(Chaobei City Map)

00:41:43.639 --> 00:41:44.039
Alright.

00:41:44.760 --> 00:41:45.400
You can go.

00:41:48.280 --> 00:41:49.000
Officer.

00:41:49.800 --> 00:41:51.159
Have you identified the victim?

00:41:53.760 --> 00:41:54.800
I don't mean anything.

00:41:55.800 --> 00:41:57.840
I was the one who hit him.

00:41:58.320 --> 00:41:59.440
I'd like to give some money

00:41:59.719 --> 00:42:00.480
to his family.

00:42:01.320 --> 00:42:03.000
Partly as compensation.

00:42:04.079 --> 00:42:05.920
Mostly to ease my own conscience.

00:42:06.440 --> 00:42:07.519
I hope you understand.

00:42:07.880 --> 00:42:08.920
So I wanted to ask,

00:42:09.519 --> 00:42:11.480
do you have his family's contact info?

00:42:13.639 --> 00:42:14.920
If compensation is needed,

00:42:15.039 --> 00:42:16.039
someone will contact you.

00:42:22.880 --> 00:42:24.199
I read in the paper

00:42:24.800 --> 00:42:26.639
the victim was a murderer.

00:42:30.920 --> 00:42:31.960
By accident,

00:42:32.239 --> 00:42:33.760
I guess I did everyone a favor.

00:42:35.719 --> 00:42:36.800
No matter who he was,

00:42:37.320 --> 00:42:38.599
you hit someone with your car.

00:42:38.760 --> 00:42:39.920
You're still responsible.

00:42:40.280 --> 00:42:42.119
That's negligence. Understand?

00:42:42.360 --> 00:42:43.440
So from now on,

00:42:43.800 --> 00:42:44.679
drive carefully.

00:42:46.440 --> 00:42:47.159
Sorry.

00:42:48.199 --> 00:42:48.759
I'll go.

00:42:48.760 --> 00:42:49.280
Go ahead.

00:43:03.039 --> 00:43:03.920
Officer.

00:43:04.960 --> 00:43:06.159
How many people

00:43:06.360 --> 00:43:07.559
did he kill?

00:43:09.719 --> 00:43:11.118
You read the paper, didn't you?

00:43:11.119 --> 00:43:12.119
It was all in there.

00:43:18.519 --> 00:43:20.360
(Police Bureau)
This wasn't mainly your fault,

00:43:20.519 --> 00:43:21.639
but be more careful.

00:43:24.679 --> 00:43:25.679
Officer.

00:43:25.800 --> 00:43:26.679
Please stop here.

00:43:26.920 --> 00:43:27.840
Thanks for your help.

00:43:27.960 --> 00:43:28.960
Drive carefully.

00:43:50.119 --> 00:43:51.239
That's where things stand.

00:43:51.639 --> 00:43:53.440
(Crime Ends)
Final checks are underway.

00:43:53.920 --> 00:43:54.800
(Killer ID'd.)
Any news,

00:43:55.159 --> 00:43:56.439
(Dies Unexpectedly)
we'll report it.

00:43:56.440 --> 00:43:56.919
Captain Wang.

00:43:56.920 --> 00:43:58.800
Police work is about evidence.

00:44:00.159 --> 00:44:00.999
Our captain's here.

00:44:01.000 --> 00:44:01.919
You can ask him.

00:44:01.920 --> 00:44:02.440
Captain Wang.

00:44:14.599 --> 00:44:15.360
Thank you.

00:44:20.039 --> 00:44:20.599
Captain Wang.

00:44:21.039 --> 00:44:21.840
Who was she?

00:44:22.199 --> 00:44:23.679
A Weihong Canal victim's daughter.

00:44:25.880 --> 00:44:26.760
Wait. Wait.

00:44:29.039 --> 00:44:30.118
A victim's daughter?

00:44:30.119 --> 00:44:30.598
Yeah.

00:44:30.599 --> 00:44:31.679
Four victims.

00:44:31.960 --> 00:44:32.760
Three weren't ever pregnant.

00:44:33.239 --> 00:44:35.280
The only one with a child had a son.

00:44:39.280 --> 00:44:41.200
(Chaobei Police Bureau)

00:44:51.280 --> 00:44:53.800
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

00:44:56.040 --> 00:44:56.980
(Photo Envelope)

00:44:56.981 --> 00:44:57.920
(Document Envelope)

00:44:58.119 --> 00:45:00.638
This is the date on Zhou Xijie's photos.

00:45:00.639 --> 00:45:01.520
(Du Yuan Missing 3/16/93)

00:45:01.720 --> 00:45:02.520
(Pickup: 3/16/93)

00:45:02.639 --> 00:45:04.239
(Yang Xinqian Missing 4/10/94)
Whether shot on

00:45:04.360 --> 00:45:05.880
or when they were developed,

00:45:06.159 --> 00:45:07.238
those two dates

00:45:07.239 --> 00:45:08.638
are when the victims were killed.

00:45:08.639 --> 00:45:09.480
Officer Tai.

00:45:09.840 --> 00:45:11.119
Thanks for your help.

00:45:12.079 --> 00:45:12.800
Dig deeper.

00:45:13.400 --> 00:45:14.239
Stay on him.

00:45:15.400 --> 00:45:16.280
That night,

